title: 'westend-relay, rococo-relay, staking-async-rc: use AutoXcmWeight for XCM weighing'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      The XCM weigher of the Westend, Rococo and staking-async relay runtimes is now built with `AutoXcmWeight` and
      `MatchedAssetWeigher` instead of a hand-written `XcmWeightInfo`. The generated generic and fungible benchmark weight
      files are merged into a single `pallet_xcm_benchmarks` module. No weight value changes.

crates:
  - name: westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: rococo-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: pallet-staking-async-rc-runtime
    bump: patch
